+| PUT | `/projects/{pid}/members` | `{"roles":{"<user>":"<role>",...}}` → 200 `[{"userId","role"}]` (all members after the change) |
+
+Roles: `manager`, `contributor`, `viewer`. `PUT .../members` is all or nothing:
+every user must be an existing member of the project and every role valid,
+otherwise 400 and nothing changes. Only managers may change roles (others who
+can read get 403), and archived projects reject it with 409. A member changed
+to `viewer` is unassigned from their tasks in the project (an assignee must be
+a contributor or manager).
 
 Statuses: `open`, `doing`, `done`. Errors are `{"error":"..."}`. Request
 bodies are JSON (`Content-Type: application/json`).
